      <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" FontWeight="SemiBold" Style="{StaticResource FocusTextBlock}" /><TextBlock Text="{Binding State}" Style="{StaticResource MutedText}" /><TextBlock Text="{Binding Review}" Style="{StaticResource MutedText}" />
